{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44030","headline":"朝云引 · 郎大家宋氏","name":"朝云引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴西巫峡指巴东，朝云触石上朝空。\n巫山巫峡高何已，行雨行云一时起。\n一时起，三春暮。\n若言来，且就阳台路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎大家宋氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}